          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nuwe yanyihire omu kuliisa igana, yandagira ati: ‘Irooko ogende, orangire abantu bange Abaisirairi.’",
          "type": "text",
